    10	- Clinician-anchored automated judging of multi-turn crisis conversations: VERA-MH (peer-reviewed), **K-Bench (2026-09)** — 94.2% judge–clinician agreement, protected test set, leaderboard. Kills "first human-anchored judge for crisis safety".
